  values ('premier-league--afc-bournemouth', 'AFC Bournemouth', 'Bournemouth', 'football', 'Premier League', 'England', 'Bournemouth', 'Vitality Stadium (Dean Court)', 11286, 'https://www.constructionnews.co.uk/buildings/85m-bournemouth-stadium-expansion-clears-planning-hurdle-28-05-2026/', 1899, 'afcb.co.uk', 'consortium', '100% owned since December 2022 by Black Knight Football Club (BKFC), a multi-club vehicle whose managing general partner is Bill Foley; NYSE-listed Cannae Holdings is BKFC''s largest limited partner (42.4% as of August 2026), alongside a minority group led by Michael B. Jordan, Ryan Sports Ventures and Vegas Golden Knights investors. BKFC also owns FC Lorient (100%) and a majority of Moreirense FC.', 'https://www.afcb.co.uk/news/club-news/afc-bournemouth-acquired-by-bill-foley-led-partnership/', 181700000, 'GBP', '2024-25 (year ended 30 June 2025)', 'AFC Bournemouth (club annual accounts release)', 'https://www.afcb.co.uk/news/2026/march/21/club-release-annual-accounts-for-2024/', 630000000, 'USD', 2025, 'Sportico', 'https://www.sportico.com/valuations/teams/2025/most-valuable-soccer-clubs-2025-real-madrid-mls-1234851509/', null, null, null, '[{"platform": "Instagram", "followers": 1000000, "as_of": "2026-09-28", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/afcb/"}, {"platform": "TikTok", "followers": 2200000, "as_of": "2026-09-28", "source_url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@afcb"}, {"platform": "X", "followers": 577075, "as_of": "2026-09-28", "source_url": "https://www.speakrj.com/audit/report/afcbournemouth/twitter"}]'::jsonb, 'Valuations diverge: Sportico''s 2025 global list puts Bournemouth at $630m, but Sportico''s Premier League ranking page (as surfaced in search) shows $145m, last in the league - the latter looks like an older data point; verify before quoting. Bournemouth is not in Forbes'' 2026 top 30. Deloitte Money League 2026 ranks the club 26th with EUR 218.5m revenue for 2024-25 (Sportcal), versus GBP 181.7m turnover in the club''s own FY2025 accounts. Cannae''s BKFC stake has fallen from 50.1% at the 2022 deal to 44.7% (Dec 2025 10-K) and 42.4% (Aug 2026 Q2 update, $263m invested) as other LPs have come in. Stake percentages for the Michael B. Jordan group and Ryan Sports Ventures are undisclosed. Purchase price of the stadium from Structadene undisclosed. Stadium expansion (c.£85m, Glenigan estimate) has planning consent; funding structure not disclosed. StadiumDB reports owners have put in c.£280m since 2022 via loans (BKFC and Goldman Sachs) and equity; the 2015 Peak6 amount and the 2019 buy-back price were never disclosed.', '["https://www.afcb.co.uk/news/club-news/afc-bournemouth-acquired-by-bill-foley-led-partnership/", "https://www.afcb.co.uk/black-knight-football-club/our-story", "https://www.sportspro.com/news/afc-bournemouth-takeover-bill-foley-golden-knights-owner/", "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/37634805/hollywood-star-michael-b-jordan-becomes-bournemouth-part-owner-us-businessman-takes-over", "https://www.sportico.com/business/sales/2023/chicago-bears-investors-buy-bill-foleys-bournemouth-1234739606/", "https://www.cannaeholdings.com/static-files/cb2a6132-fbee-491f-88aa-f7d1829f5c05", "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1704720/000170472026000045/cnne-20251231.htm", "https://www.cannaeholdings.com/news-releases/news-release-details/cannae-holdings-inc-announces-black-knight-football-clubs-bkfc", "https://www.isportconnect.com/afc-bournemouth-confirm-deal-with-peak6-investments-for-25-stake/", "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11743/11620686/maxim-demin-retakes-full-ownership-of-bournemouth", "https://www.afcb.co.uk/news/2026/march/21/club-release-annual-accounts-for-2024/", "https://theesk.org/2026/05/11/the-analysis-series-afc-bournemouth-limited-annual-report-and-financial-statements-for-the-year-ended-30-june-2025/", "https://swissramble.substack.com/p/bournemouth-finances-202425", "https://www.sportcal.com/analyst-comment/does-the-2026-deloitte-football-money-league-represent-a-new-world-order/", "https://www.sportico.com/valuations/teams/2025/most-valuable-soccer-clubs-2025-real-madrid-mls-1234851509/", "https://www.sportico.com/feature/premier-league-team-valuations-list-1234707256/", "https://www.forbes.com/sites/justinteitelbaum/2026/05/29/the-worlds-most-valuable-soccer-teams-2026/", "https://www.afcb.co.uk/news/2025/april/25/afc-bournemouth-announces-acquisition-of-vitality-stadium/", "https://www.thestadiumbusiness.com/2025/04/28/afc-bournemouth-reacquires-vitality-stadium-amid-development-plans/", "https://www.constructionnews.co.uk/buildings/85m-bournemouth-stadium-expansion-clears-planning-hurdle-28-05-2026/", "https://stadiumdb.com/news/2026/03/england_vitality_stadium_redevelopment_could_begin_this_summer_investment_details_revealed", "https://www.eventmasters.co.uk/vitality-stadium.html", "https://www.instagram.com/afcb/", "https://www.tiktok.com/@afcb", "https://www.speakrj.com/audit/report/afcbournemouth/twitter"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'web_research')
